<contentList>
	<content contentuid="h34deed3dg3c05g4687g8be8g432d12862223" version="1">&lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt; to &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Intelligence"&gt;Intelligence&lt;/LSTag&gt;, &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Wisdom"&gt;Wisdom&lt;/LSTag&gt; and &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Charisma"&gt;Charisma&lt;/LSTag&gt; until the first &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_INFO_SPELL"&gt;spell&lt;/LSTag&gt; you cast or the first weapon attack you make.</content>
	<content contentuid="h79bf5171ga43fg4794g9645g8b676b40b917" version="1">&lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt; to all &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Ability"&gt;Abilities&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;You are &lt;b&gt;invulnerable&lt;/b&gt; to attacks that deal &lt;b&gt;[2] or less damage&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;No &lt;b&gt;harmful effect&lt;/b&gt; can be applied to you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dispels when killing a foe.</content>
	<content contentuid="h54ea4baag6fa1g46d2ga6cegbafdee5f770c" version="1">Titled Fool</content>
	<content contentuid="h07850438g67bag42b6ga270gca9d93f213fe" version="1">Any&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; dealt to you also leaves you &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="VICIOUSMOCKERY"&gt;Viciously Mocked&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; turn(s).</content>
	<content contentuid="h48bcea9bgf492g41bbga8efga00a94d1a2f6" version="1">Any&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; dealt to you also leaves you &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="VICIOUSMOCKERY"&gt;Viciously Mocked&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; turn(s).&lt;br&gt;Any&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; you deal leaves the creature &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="VICIOUSMOCKERY"&gt;Viciously Mocked&lt;/LSTag&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; turn(s).</content>
	<content contentuid="hb1348f84g4b14g45d1ga1dag04a3c62c07ab" version="1">His Radiant Excellency</content>
	<content contentuid="h9aa783e4g3b17g4389gb75egc4ae6cebb5b8" version="1">While your &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Charisma"&gt;Charisma&lt;/LSTag&gt; is &lt;b&gt;not your highest&lt;/b&gt; Ability, at the &lt;b&gt;start&lt;/b&gt; of your turn in combat you shed &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="MAG_THUNDER_REVERBERATION"&gt;Reverberation&lt;/LSTag&gt;, &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLINDED"&gt;Blindness&lt;/LSTag&gt; and &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SLOW"&gt;Slow&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
	<content contentuid="h1e59f90dga05fg4737gae7cg5fdbf3610b28" version="1">Appoint a Hero</content>
	<content contentuid="h38c53332g4cb6g42eaga65cg07b4831f370a" version="1">Name an ally&lt;i&gt;(or yourself)&lt;/i&gt; the &lt;b&gt;hero&lt;/b&gt; of your new manuscript. The &lt;b&gt;hero&lt;/b&gt; is permanently &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLESS"&gt;Blessed&lt;/LSTag&gt;, and every &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_INFO_SPELL"&gt;spell&lt;/LSTag&gt; of the &lt;b&gt;Abjuration&lt;/b&gt; school they cast grants &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="HEROISM"&gt;Heroism&lt;/LSTag&gt; to their allies within &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; turn(s).</content>
	<content contentuid="h0d54ca1eg295eg4fc3g96abgc7dfcaf1395c" version="1">Hero of the Manuscript</content>
	<content contentuid="h96d7a574gad2dg4075g9804gc060b8435c81" version="1">You are the hero of a manuscript still being written: permanently &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLESS"&gt;Blessed&lt;/LSTag&gt;. Every &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_INFO_SPELL"&gt;spell&lt;/LSTag&gt; of the &lt;b&gt;Abjuration&lt;/b&gt; school you cast grants &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="HEROISM"&gt;Heroism&lt;/LSTag&gt; to your &lt;b&gt;allies&lt;/b&gt; within &lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt; for &lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt; turn(s).</content>
	<content contentuid="hfb23f9bdgd278g4453g8a94g21be82c91838" version="1">Protector of the Weak</content>
	<content contentuid="h19b84911g7242g4eeag9dd6g62f07e4adc10" version="1">Unless you are an &lt;b&gt;Oathbreaker&lt;/b&gt;&lt;i&gt;(but someone else)&lt;/i&gt;, finishing a task &lt;b&gt;kindly&lt;/b&gt; grants &lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;Armour Class&lt;/LSTag&gt; until your next &lt;LSTag Tooltip="LongRest"&gt;Long Rest&lt;/LSTag&gt;, up to &lt;b&gt;+[2]&lt;/b&gt;.</content>
	<content contentuid="h863595a1g6ee3g4f7agb39eg887ebb1343ee" version="1">&lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;Armour Class&lt;/LSTag&gt; for every task you finished &lt;b&gt;kindly&lt;/b&gt;, up to &lt;b&gt;+[2]&lt;/b&gt;. Lasts until your next &lt;LSTag Tooltip="LongRest"&gt;Long Rest&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
</contentList>
